&lt;h2&gt;Establishing the profile&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="establishing-the-profile"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#establishing-the-profile" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Volatility3 resolves symbols automatically rather than using Volatility2-style
profiles, which removes the single most common source of &amp;ldquo;it just doesn&amp;rsquo;t
work&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- TODO(om): note where the symbol cache lives, and what to do when it is
