&lt;a href="#plugin-order" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is a rough triage sequence that answers &amp;ldquo;what was this machine doing&amp;rdquo;
faster than picking plugins ad hoc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- TODO(om): your actual order. Something like:
1. `windows.info` — confirm the image parses and identify the build
